<PageFrame
  title="About this website | Northstar Academy test project"
  description="Learn what the Northstar Academy test website is for. It explores educational search content and does not represent an operating academy."
>
  <main class="content-page wrap" id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <header class="content-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS PROJECT</p>
      <h1>What is the Northstar Academy website?</h1>
      <p class="content-lede">Northstar Academy is the name of a test SEO project exploring clear, useful content about technology and digital learning topics.</p>
      <p class="project-disclosure"><strong>Transparency:</strong> This is not an operating academy or training provider. It has no enrollment, classes, instructors, campus, or student services.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>What this project explores</h2>
      <p>The website tests how a small, structured set of educational topic guides can answer common research questions. Its topics include AI web development, digital marketing, product design, and data analytics because those topics already appear on the homepage.</p>
      <p>Those topic pages explain concepts and questions a learner can use when comparing real providers. They are not course listings, an academy curriculum, or a promise that Northstar Academy provides instruction.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>Why Kozhikode and Calicut appear on the site</h2>
      <p>Kozhikode and Calicut are used as the geographic focus for testing local educational search intent. This does not mean Northstar Academy has an office, campus, staff, or active service in the area.</p>
      <p>For practical guidance on comparing real options, read the <a href="/locations/kozhikode/">Kozhikode technology-learning research guide</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>How to use the topic guides</h2>
      <p>Use them to understand broad subject areas and prepare questions for an actual education provider. Confirm course availability, syllabus, format, prerequisites, fees, teaching staff, and location directly with that provider.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/courses/">Browse the educational topic guides <span>↗</span></a>
    </section>
  </main>
</PageFrame>
